OL,3,AWhat Jensen Huang's return teaches     
OL,4,AChina's Xi about Trump                 
OL,6,FBut to many, Huang's return, which is  
OL,7,Fbeing dubbed one of the greatest       
OL,8,FU-turns of all time, seems like a      
OL,9,Fvindication for China.                 
OL,11,FThat's probably how Xi Jinping sees it 
OL,12,Ftoo.                                   
